    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "BARRY AUCTIONEERS & VALUERS welcome you to this substantial seven-bedroom detached investment property on Magazine Road, Cork, ideally positioned just approximately 300 metres from University College Cork.\r\n\r\nFor investors, the location is a major attraction. The property's close proximity to UCC places it within easy walking distance of the university campus, making it particularly well positioned to appeal to the student and academic rental market, subject to the property's existing configuration, tenancy arrangements and any applicable planning requirements.\r\n\r\nThe property offers seven bedrooms, providing excellent accommodation capacity and flexibility. The detached nature of the house is another particularly attractive feature, offering a level of privacy and independence that can be difficult to find in such a central location.\r\n\r\nThe property also benefits from off-street parking for two cars, an increasingly valuable feature so close to Cork city centre and UCC.\r\n\r\nMagazine Road is an established and highly sought-after residential location, with UCC, Cork city centre, local shops, cafés, restaurants and public transport all within easy reach. The combination of location, accommodation and parking makes this a property with strong appeal for an investor looking for a well-located rental asset.\r\n\r\nFrom an investment perspective, the key selling points are clear: seven bedrooms, detached accommodation, two off-street parking spaces and an exceptional location approximately 300 metres from UCC.\r\n\r\nThis is a property that offers investors the opportunity to acquire a substantial residential asset in one of Cork's most established and convenient locations.\r\n\r\nProperties offering this combination of bedroom capacity, detached accommodation and proximity to UCC are relatively unusual, so we would strongly recommend arranging a viewing to appreciate the property's full potential.”"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Rooms",
        "SortOrder": 2,
        "Content": "Ground Floor: - \r\n\r\n\r\nKitchen 1: - \r\nFully fitted kitchen\n\r\n\r\nKitchen 2 - \r\nFully fitted kitchen\r\n\r\nDining Room / Bedroom 4 - \r\nLocated to the right-hand side\r\n\r\nBedroom 1 - \r\nLocated to the left-hand side\n\r\n\r\nBedroom 2 - \r\nLocated to the left-hand side\n\r\n\r\nBedroom 3 - \r\nLocated to the left-hand side\r\n\r\nFirst Floor - \r\n\r\n\r\nBedroom 5 - \r\nLocated to the right-hand side\n\r\n\r\nBedroom 6 - \r\nLocated to the right-hand side\n\r\n\r\nBedroom 7 - \r\nLocated to the right-hand side\r\n\r\nShower Room - \r\nShower, W.C. and W.H.B.\r\n\r\nSeparate Toilet - \r\nW.C. and W.H.B.\n\r\n\r\nOutside - \r\nThe property benefits from parking to the front and a yard area to the rear.\r\n\r\n"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "Off street parking for two cars\r\nExcellent investment opportunity\r\n300 metres from UCC and Bons Secure hospital\r\nNatural gas central heating.\r\nMain bus route\r\nDouble glazing throughout\r\nExcellent shared living and dining space\r\nPrime location"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "BER Details",
